{"html":"<h1 id=\"vkf-linear-algebra-comparison-evidence\">VKF linear-algebra comparison evidence</h1>\n<p>Host: <code>AMD EPYC 9V74 80-Core Processor                </code>, win32-x64 Samples: 10; threads: 1</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll benchmark-table\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Kernel</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF mean ± std</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / eigen</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / faer</th><th scope=\"col\">VKF / scipy</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>solve-general-96</td><td>0.085 ± 0.009 ms</td><td>0.773</td><td>0.626</td><td>0.546</td></tr><tr><td>least-squares-tall-96x48</td><td>0.083 ± 0.012 ms</td><td>0.761</td><td>0.845</td><td>0.605</td></tr><tr><td>lu-general-96</td><td>0.066 ± 0.016 ms</td><td>0.624</td><td>0.619</td><td>0.788</td></tr><tr><td>qr-tall-96x48</td><td>0.080 ± 0.009 ms</td><td>0.370</td><td>0.450</td><td>0.517</td></tr><tr><td>cholesky-spd-96</td><td>0.035 ± 0.002 ms</td><td>0.470</td><td>1.254</td><td>0.760</td></tr><tr><td>svd-tall-96x48</td><td>0.271 ± 0.043 ms</td><td>0.229</td><td>0.424</td><td>0.464</td></tr><tr><td>eigen-symmetric-96</td><td>1.060 ± 0.083 ms</td><td>0.926</td><td>1.092</td><td>1.140</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Ratios use operation-only time on one host. Every accepted sample passed numerical accuracy gates.</p>","headings":[{"level":1,"title":"VKF linear-algebra comparison evidence","id":"vkf-linear-algebra-comparison-evidence"}],"examples":[],"source":"benchmarks/linalg-comparison/results/windows-x64-045.md","route":"benchmarks/linalg-0.4.5.html","releaseCatalog":{"schema":"vektor-flow/release-catalog-v1","latest":"0.4.7","latestBrowserRuntime":{"version":"0.4.7","url":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=f966e564b2718e29ae931514d0813892aedafd31068eccb8eb9db46576eeb72c"},"releases":[{"version":"0.4.7","tag":"v0.4.7","status":"published","browserRuntimeWasm":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf